OL,3,GNEWSAPlans for new 550-home village
OL,4,Aapproved
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans to build a new village in North
OL,7,FLincolnshire made up of 550 homes have
OL,8,Fbeen approved.
OL,10,FThe village will be located on land on
OL,11,Fthe western edge of Scunthorpe as part
OL,12,Fof the Trent Vale project, which aims
OL,13,Fto create six distinct villages in the
OL,14,Farea.
OL,16,FAccording to planning documents, a GP
OL,17,Fsurgery and pharmacy could be part of a
OL,18,Flocal centre located in the village.
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
