OL,3,GNEWSAPlans for new 550-home village
OL,4,Aapproved
OL,5,
OL,6,FCouncil leader Rob Waltham said: "This
OL,7,Fis another important step in turning
OL,8,Fthe long-term plans for Trent Vale into
OL,9,Fsomething real."
